Mailed From: Whitehall, Illinois on May 7, 1909&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Miss Virginia Johnston&lt;br&gt;
Pearl, Illinois&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Dearest Girlie,&lt;br&gt;
Am having a most wonderful time. Will be by soon.&lt;br&gt;
Lovingly,&lt;br&gt;
Maudine&lt;/p&gt;</description>
